WEBVTT

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.810
There's no other choice.

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:08.580
We can't have things go 
back to how they were then.

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:13.490
We must keep lying about men being scary.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:27.170
Men... aren't scary?

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:03.260
<b>Men and Women</b>

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:03.560
Tsubaki.

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:05.870
Konoha-sensei!

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:07.270
Stop this instant.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:12.730
Ah, I see.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.120
<i>A leaf?!</i>

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.540
My, my.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:52.330
Substitution...

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:54.320
Impressive, in that short a time.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:55.700
However...

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:04.660
If even one gets on you, there's no 
escape from the Dancing Leaves Jutsu.

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:08.160
Konoha-sensei! I-I...

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:11.330
Hana-sensei will decide what to do.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.330
For the time being...

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.080
you will sleep.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:29.140
Looks like you're awake.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.610
Sit her up.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.450
Sensei...

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:44.440
So, what will you do with Tsubaki?

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.250
Just have her remain silent...

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.080
or have her leave Akane Class?

00:03:57.430 --> 00:04:00.110
Leave? No!

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:02.050
Tsubaki.

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:09.350
I'm going to tell you everything.

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:10.850
Huh?

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:14.620
You will keep it from the 
other students, of course.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.390
Are you sure?

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:21.240
It'd be even harder to keep her quiet, 
if she knows only part of it.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.660
It's your decision, Hana-sensei...

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:39.360
There is a term called "romantic love."

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.910
It means to develop feelings 
for one of the opposite sex.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:51.680
I hear everyone experiences it 
when they come of age.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.140
Love?

00:04:56.890 --> 00:04:58.980
This might surprise you,

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:02.300
but Akane Class and Aoi Class used to mingle.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:07.030
And all the students were in love.

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:09.870
Men and women...

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:11.840
in love...

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.580
Tsubaki?

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:23.250
W-We think that men are scary, 
and that in other villages,

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:26.760
we live with them grudgingly 
because it's just how things are...

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:29.910
Why lie to us like that?!

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:32.220
I'm in the process of telling you.

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:34.900
Oh, right.

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:35.890
May I continue?

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:38.100
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:45.140
The students of Akane Class and Aoi Class

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:47.460
who were in love dedicated 
themselves to training,

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:51.540
but found what time they could 
to meet and be together.

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:57.080
But gradually, there emerged those 
for whom that alone couldn't satisfy.

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:02.380
They wanted more time together, 
to the exclusion of all else.

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:05.490
Even if it meant abandoning this life.

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:07.130
You mean...

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:10.650
Yes, they left the village together.

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:14.220
Out in the world, 
that's known as "elopement."

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.310
Elopement!

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:20.840
As a result, more and more couples eloped.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:25.610
There were many who couldn't be satisfied 
with just a little time together.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:31.450
And apparently, "elopement" is a very 
enticing word for young men and women.

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:38.030
One couple eloped after the next,

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:40.860
and the number of students dropped sharply.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:45.800
Fearful that there would be no more ninjas,

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.700
the leaders of each class 
discussed the matter,

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:50.720
and decided to disallow 
interaction between the classes.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.970
Then we taught that the 
opposite sex is scary,

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:58.270
and made rules forbidding contact with them.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:00.930
That's how it's been now for generations.

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.200
So, that's the way things are.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:08.150
Now do you see the point of that game of tag?

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:10.990
If more students start making fun of men,

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:13.280
there will probably emerge those

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.370
who attempt to defeat them, 
much like Sazanka and Benisumomo.

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:20.250
If the two genders were to meet, 
we don't know what would happen.

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:25.000
<i>This is too much to take in at once.</i>

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.530
<i>My mind is a mess.</i>

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:31.550
<i>Wh-What am I supposed to do?!</i>

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:32.970
Tsubaki.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.430
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.830
I <i>am</i> surprised, though.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.150
While it's true that I was 
distracted by my back pain,

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:44.690
your Transformation Jutsu was 
so good, it fooled even me.

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:47.590
You will make a fine kunoichi.

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:53.940
Th-Thank you, ma'am.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:58.620
Um, Sensei.

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:02.280
I think from now on,

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:06.130
I too would like to warn students 
who don't seem wary of men.

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:07.500
Mhm.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:13.430
And so... I'd like to ask 
for something in return...

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:18.600
Th-Thank you!

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:22.280
Food!

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:23.940
I knew you could do it, Nee-sama.

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:23.940
Thank you!

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:27.260
I can't believe you managed 
to get Sensei's hair tie.

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:28.290
How'd you do it?

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:29.400
Way to go!

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:34.860
<i>I never thought asking to reinstate 
dinner would lead to all this.</i>

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:38.000
<i>It's sort of like I'm deceiving 
them, so I have mixed feelings.</i>

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:38.860
Tsubaki-chan!

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:40.320
Thanks, Tsubaki.

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:42.330
It's all thanks to you!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:43.440
Good stuff.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.520
I wasn't sure how things would turn out.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.520
Nee-sama! Nee-sama! Nee-sama!

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:47.400
<i>I</i> got caught right away.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:48.540
Me, too.

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:52.170
I was <i>sure</i> she wouldn't find <i>me</i>, though.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.820
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

00:08:57.710 --> 00:08:59.380
Was this a good idea?

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:00.390
Mhm.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:04.820
Well, from now on Tsubaki will help us,

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:07.310
so I'm willing to grant them their dinner.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.420
No, I didn't mean that.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:10.380
Sensei.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:12.500
What's up?

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:15.480
Um, there's something I'd like to ask.

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.150
What?

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.240
Well...

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:24.910
Wh-When you fall in love, 
what the heck happens to you?

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.640
Um, I was just wondering!

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:31.380
Let's see.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:35.920
Your heart pounds, your body feels hot,

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.840
and it feels as if your mind goes blank.

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:42.180
Or, so I'm told.

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:47.140
Your heart pounds, you feel hot, 
and your mind goes blank...

00:09:47.870 --> 00:09:49.660
Thank you very much.

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:50.420
Excuse me.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.060
Hana-sensei.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:55.740
What I was trying to say is,

00:09:56.230 --> 00:10:00.070
was it a good idea to 
tell Tsubaki everything?

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:06.490
Tsubaki's going to be fine.

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:10.360
Because she's already 
an outstanding kunoichi.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:13.340
Well, fair enough.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:17.070
But you know, the girl is 
old enough to be interested.

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:23.720
She'll be fine.

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:26.980
It sounds like you're telling yourself that.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:36.320
<i>It was "love."</i>

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:43.520
<i>It's love!</i>

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:52.020
<i>But I've never even seen a man.</i>

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:56.630
<i>So, </i>is<i> it love...?</i>

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:06.310
<b>Mokuren's Medical Jutsu</b>

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:02.380
Good morning.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.600
Such nice weather.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:08.600
Asagao!

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:11.300
Huh? I can't find my hair clip!

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.360
What should we do for fun today?

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:13.940
Come on, it's time you got up.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:20.900
<b>Monkey</b>

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:28.650
It's a day off!

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:30.250
Mhm.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.710
I'm so happy. It's our day off!

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:34.780
"Day off."

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:38.340
Yes, I even like the way it sounds.

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:43.970
Today I'm going to take a walk and 
pick fruit, and relax while I eat it.

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:48.000
Mokuren! I'm gonna go beat 
Sazanka, and I need help!

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:50.010
Huh? Um...

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:51.720
Stop that, Housenka.

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:54.980
You know how Mokuren can't say no to a favor.

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:57.400
Then <i>you</i> help me, Tsuwabuki!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:00.270
After this, I'm playing 
go with Fuki and the gang.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:00.990
<b>Housenka</b>

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:04.820
That's never going to help 
us take Team Dog's name!

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:06.190
We don't need it.

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:08.830
How about you use your head a little, too?

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.910
Go is a great game.

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:13.900
All you ever do is lose!

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:15.750
"Use your head," indeed.

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:19.090
That, coming from a violent, 
musclebound... ape.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.060
Oh?!

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:24.320
Sounds like you need some discipline!

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:26.890
You little monkey!

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:30.130
It's because you talked 
about using your head!

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:33.680
Shut your mouth!

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:35.610
What're you doing?!

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:36.600
You little...!

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:38.470
It's not my fault!

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:46.050
Get back here!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.010
There we go.

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:55.000
<b>Monkey</b>

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:01.840
Things got off to a rough start,

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:05.020
but now I get my relaxing day off!

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:25.490
You're so skillful.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.550
One-two.

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:29.700
Huh?

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:33.160
Did you fall in? Come here.

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:53.640
Sour!

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:55.970
This one is...

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.270
sweet!

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.090
You want some?

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:07.760
All right.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.330
Mokuren!

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:18.330
What's up?

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:21.550
I'm afraid Ajisai twisted her wrist.

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:24.280
Could you do that thing? The "whap" thing.

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:25.920
I just need medicinal herbs.

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:31.170
But it's our day off, and you can't fully 
enjoy yourself with your hand like that.

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:32.300
But...

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.260
Let me see it.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:39.720
B-Be gentle.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:49.360
Ow!

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:52.200
Didn't I say "be gentle"?!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.780
Sorry. How's your left hand?

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:58.120
It's better!

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:00.500
That's good.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.250
Thank you!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:03.740
Take care.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:11.050
Doing that sure does tire me out.

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:14.760
I had better train some more.

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:46.630
Tsubaki!

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:51.500
There.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:55.420
Did Housenka show up at 
Team Dog's place again?

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:57.060
No, she hasn't come by.

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:58.590
No?

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:00.980
Where are you, Nee-sama?!

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.650
Mokuren! Have you seen Nee-sama?!

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:05.200
Um...

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:07.000
She's been kinda weird all day!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.650
If you see her, ask her why!

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.080
Nee-sama!

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.420
What's the matter?

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:21.770
Sazanka's blowing it out of proportion.

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:23.920
I've just been thinking about something.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:25.510
Oh, okay.

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:30.570
Hey, look.

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:32.840
Over there.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.300
A bird nest.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.180
Cute, aren't they?

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:43.820
I wanted to see it with you.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.780
Mokuren.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:54.590
Would you mind... listening to...

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:57.410
what I have to say?

00:16:58.290 --> 00:16:59.530
No problem.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:07.080
Um, how to put this...

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:13.300
The thing is, I kind of wound up 
with a secret I can't tell anyone.

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:15.260
Mokuren!

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.880
Come with us!

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:19.070
We need a favor from the medical team!

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:20.590
Okay, I'll be there later.

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:22.310
No, we need you now!

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.030
Right now?

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:28.060
Sorry, but could you ask Tsuwabuki?

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.650
She's too busy playing go to do it!

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.320
And Housenka's passed out next to her!

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:35.820
Please, Mokuren!

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:37.820
Go on. Go with them.

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:39.630
Sounds like they're in a hurry.

00:17:41.110 --> 00:17:43.220
I'll listen once I'm done.

00:17:43.220 --> 00:17:44.950
Mokuren, hurry!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.770
This is it.

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:50.250
Um...

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:53.210
A broken teacup?

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.390
Fuki treasures this one!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:57.430
<b>Team
Tiger</b>

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:57.880
Please! Fix it with your "whap" thing!

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:02.300
Well, I can only use that on living beings.

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:04.920
Fuki's gonna kill us!

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:06.110
Then what do we do?!

00:18:06.110 --> 00:18:07.690
I'm sure it'll be okay.

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:10.860
She'll forgive you if you apologize properly.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:11.900
Mokuren...

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:14.750
Could you come with us when we do it?

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:15.890
Sure thing.

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:18.530
We're sorry!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:22.910
That turns out like this, 
and this turns out like that...

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:22.910
Don't worry about it.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:26.330
And if not, then this, and that, and...

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.790
More importantly, were you hurt?

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:31.420
Mokuren!

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:57.920
Mokuren!

00:18:58.010 --> 00:18:59.480
Mokuren!

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:01.020
Mokuren!

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:02.730
Mokuren!

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:04.110
Mokuren!

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:10.080
Tsubaki.

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.520
Sorry I took so long.

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:16.050
That's fine. But you look completely drained.

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:19.130
We can wait and talk 
another time, if you like.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:22.590
It's okay, this always happens.

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:25.940
You really never say no.

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:31.020
I'm bad at refusing, 
so everyone asks me to do things.

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:33.560
No, Mokuren, that's...

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:37.070
You know, I'm happy when they ask me.

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:41.770
Doing things for everyone...

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:45.750
I'm on Team Monkey.

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:51.850
So, that's my job.

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.630
Your job...

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.050
Say, Mokuren.

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:03.100
Please whap my forehead.

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:06.610
S-Sure, but... does your head hurt?

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:09.200
No, you don't have to use the Jutsu.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:09.720
Huh?

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:11.720
Just go on. Do it.

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:12.640
All right.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:18.150
A-Are you okay?

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:20.840
Yes! Thank you!

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:22.560
I'll be going now.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:23.110
Huh?

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:24.570
What about talking?

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:27.530
You helped me remember.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:31.870
My job is to be stout-hearted.

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:34.960
Right.

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:37.030
Hey, Mokuren.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:41.800
Everyone asks you for things, 
not because you don't refuse,

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:44.480
but because they rely on you.

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:48.610
Sazanka is worried, so I'm going to go.

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:02.360
I'm tired.

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:06.950
I'll sleep just for a bit.

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:10.090
Hey.

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:13.110
Wake up, Mokuren. You'll catch a cold.

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:19.340
Good morning. Are you done playing go?

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:22.680
What are you talking about? 
It's night already.

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:25.530
This is too lazy even for a day off, Mokuren.

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:26.510
Let's go home.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:28.540
We looked all over for you.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:33.020
Huh?!

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:05.230
Mokuren!

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:07.690
What's the matter today?

00:23:07.690 --> 00:23:16.160
<b>Monkey</b>

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:11.870
Are you okay? Your face is all red.

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:13.330
Do you have a fever?

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:15.240
Maybe "fever" isn't the word...

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:17.970
Is your heart pounding, by chance?

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:20.120
<b>A
k
a
n
e

00:23:17.970 --> 00:23:18.560
Huh?!

00:23:19.520 --> 00:23:20.120
Yeah.

00:23:20.630 --> 00:23:21.870
Your body feels hot?

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:23.290
Yeah! Yeah!

00:23:23.770 --> 00:23:26.920
And it feels as if your mind goes blank?

00:23:26.920 --> 00:23:28.300
You know what it is?!

00:23:28.880 --> 00:23:30.430
Sure, no problem.

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:32.240
I'll cure you.

00:23:32.240 --> 00:23:33.010
Huh?

00:23:36.760 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next time:

00:23:37.570 --> 00:23:39.500
To be continued...
